   "type": "text",
   "text": "The inversion: openrig's refocus ASKS the agent whether it has drifted. We own a calibrated judge (JEV noul = P(true)) \u2014 once R2's deterministic counters exist,\npromote them to a gated cascade scoring P(this scenario serves the plan intent), ONCE per implement pass over the merged set. Cheap filter first, judge the residue.",
